6. `tests/takerAI.test.js`: **4 / 4 PASS** (dive habit Markov model, early dive punishment, Hell corner targeting)
7. `tests/taunts.test.js`: **22 / 22 PASS** (33 authentic HK Cantonese lines, tell honesty and deception rates)
8. `tests/match_integration.test.js`: **5 / 5 PASS** (full 5-round shootouts across EASY/MEDIUM/HARD/HELL without throwing)

**Total: 65 / 65 PASS**

